<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">Hi All<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"text-indent:5.25pt"><span lang=3D"EN-US">Th=
is is the weekly test report for Yocto 1.3 20120523 build. QA tested all QE=
MUs and BSPs, as well as ADT. There are 6 issues found in this build, &nbsp=
;X server could not start up successful to
 the Desktop on emenlow<span style=3D"color:#1F497D">,</span> reported as b=
ug 2507; one minor issue on qemumips, the fotowall can run on qemumips, but=
 the icons look abnormal, another minor issue &nbsp;is for qemu no-x86=A1=
=AFs connmand-properties,&nbsp; the picture can not
 display in 'About' option; one issues is for meta-recipse, eglibc-2.15 com=
pile fail when rebuild with different commits and arch; For ADT, QA checked=
 the basic functions of adt-installer, meta-toolchain, poky build tree and =
eclipse tools, only two minor issues
 found, Yocto-bsp tool doesn't read the value of reedited &quot;output loca=
tion&quot; and sometimes Eclipse Could not create the hostShellProcess when=
 debugging remote BSPs, other features perform well.<span style=3D"color:#1=
F497D"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"text-indent:10.5pt"><span lang=3D"EN-US">No=
te: The test report is archived @
<a href=3D"https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Yocto_1.3_Weekly_Test_Report"=
>https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Yocto_1.3_Weekly_Test_Report</a><o:p></=
o:p></span></p>
